-full.heic?v=8793abd1d2","width":1800,"height":2250,"placeholderColor":"#433c32","sourceUrl":"https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/437903","rightsStatus":"public_domain"}},{"id":"berlioz-symphonie-fantastique","contentLocale":"tr","composer":{"id":"berlioz","name":"Hector Berlioz","shortName":"Berlioz"},"title":"Fantastik Senfoni","catalogue":"Op. 14","keyLabel":"Do majör","year":1830,"era":"romantic","form":"symphony","durationMin":55,"movementCount":5,"hook":"Beş sahnede anlatılan, bir cadılar sabbatında sona eren bir saplantı.","painting":{"artist":"Francisco Goya","title":"Cadılar Sabbatı ya da Büyük Teke","yearLabel":"1820–1823","collection":"Museo del Prado, Madrid","pairingNote":"Senfoniden on yıl içinde boyandı; Berlioz’un finalinde sahneye koyduğu aynı kâbus toplantısı.","medium":"Oil on mural, transferred to canvas","imageUrl":"https://api.dailyclassical.co/images/paintings/berlioz-symphonie-fantastique-hero.heic?v=7dca77cab1","thumbUrl":"https://api.dailyclassical.co/images/paintings/berlioz-symphonie-fantastique-thumb.heic?v=92acb83829","fullUrl":"https://api.dailyclassical.co/images/paintings/berlioz-symphonie-fantastique-full.heic?v=8afd1cb5a1","width":3051,"height":966,"placeholderColor":"#413421","sourceUrl":"https://www.museodelprado.es/en/the-collection/art-work/witches-sabbath-or-the-great-he-goat/09559184-cfeb-48fe-8acc-89b070b64d92","rightsStatus":"public_domain"}},{"id":"brahms-clarinet-quintet","contentLocale":"tr","composer":{"id":"brahms","name":"Johannes Brahms","shortName":"Brahms"},"title":"Si minör Klarnet Beşlisi","catalogue":"Op. 115","keyLabel":"Si minör","year":1891,"era":"romantic","form":"chamber","durationMin":37,"movementCount":4,"hook":"Brahms besteciliği bırakmaya karar vermişti; sonra bir klarnetçiyi dinledi ve bu sonbahar renkli vedayı yazdı.","painting":{"artist":"Vilhelm Hammershøi","title":"Arkası Dönük Genç Kadınla İç Mekân","yearLabel":"1903–04","collection":"Randers Sanat Müzesi, Danimarka","pairingNote":"Gri